    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but the professionals... they just want to fix the lights, you know? they want to patch the walls. they don't get that the structure itself is rotting. it’s not something you can just \"work through.\" it feels more like a natural conclusion. like, why stay in a house that's already empty?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
