      "content": "When you feel that the end is unavoidable, the idea of taking control over the timing can feel like the only source of agency left. If the darkness seems more peaceful than the slow fade, that is a very real and powerful feeling you are experiencing. Because you are in such a place of profound despair, please know that there are people who can actively listen to this desire for control without trying to force a \"fix.\" You can connect with the National Suicide Prevention Lifeline by calling or texting 988 in the US and Canada, or by calling 111 in the UK.",
